control: The API server's coalesced policy load runs on the host's goroutines, and a load that cannot run fails its callers
removes: the load starts on a goroutine of its own rather than through the starter, so the host neither recovers it nor waits for it
packages: ./api/internal/reload
tests: TestEveryLoadRunsThroughTheStarter
scheduled-count: no

